  "title": "Guy NDE 40",
  "date": "2/98",
  "content": "I died. Simply, I died. I was there, in the ICU....They were trying to save me...but I still died. Death was not bad. Jesus was really there. He and I were looking over the edge of the pit, sort of looking at where hell was. It reminded me of when I was little, looking over the edge of a bridge to the water below....it wasn't scary, just looking. He put His Arm around me. He loved me. Perhaps we were looking back at earth, I don't know. I want more recollection of it all, because it is so important.. but as I said above, they were giving me medicines, and I just can't remember everything. But I know I was There!! And I know I died. And I know that I woke up again in my own body, and I was SO SAD. Sad beyond words. I had been to Freedom with God...now I was trapped back here.",
